        "value": "Personal name Yoshimura Sakusuke. It stands alone in the lower name register to the RIGHT of the ○仙臺藩 marker, so it closes the officials roster of the domain printed before Sendai, Mori (母里藩, Izumo), whose rank headings and eight other appointees are on the facing leaf (page 469). No rank heading is printed above this column, so this leaf does not say which councillor grade he held."
